:54-07:00","id":275582,"title":"","content":"I'm going to guess, based on the pattern of other &quot;complex refinements&quot;, that Phosphorus favors the Vulcanus Transmutations (as that would seem to fit much better than Alchemicus with the self-immolation theme) and a new Transmutation type they alone favor.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-03T11:47:35-08:00","id":301383,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/263521-phosphorus-the-new-refinement-in-2e?p=275582#post275582\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm going to guess, based on the pattern of other &quot;complex refinements&quot;, that Phosphorus favors the Vulcanus Transmutations (as that would seem to fit much better than Alchemicus with the self-immolation theme) and a new Transmutation type they alone favor.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> You are correct.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"at